@host = http://localhost:5292

### Config (anonymous)
GET {{host}}/api/config/registration
Accept: application/json

### Register student account
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Jane Student",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "phone": "+1234567890",
  "password": "Student123!"
}

### Login (student or admin)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@dreamteam.test",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Current student profile (Bearer token required)
GET {{host}}/api/students/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Initiate payment — replace ids after login
POST {{host}}/api/payments/initiate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "method": "mpesa"
}

### Admin: all users
GET {{host}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: students with matricule
GET {{host}}/api/admin/students/with-matricule
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: all payments
GET {{host}}/api/admin/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: delete user
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Verify matricule (anonymous)
GET {{host}}/api/matricules/verify?code=DTE-2026-XXXXXX
Accept: application/json
